Changshou.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.260
Putera Kecil.

01:52.280 --> 01:52.900
Changshou.

01:53.790 --> 01:55.210
Bantu dia bangun, kawan-kawan.

01:55.230 --> 01:55.570
Faham.

01:55.590 --> 01:56.210
Cepat.

02:10.430 --> 02:11.290
Awak...

02:11.750 --> 02:13.450
Lakonan yang bagus.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.450
Junior.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.290
Warga emas.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.940
Senior, awak...

02:20.190 --> 02:20.610
Junior.

02:20.630 --> 02:21.980
Berikan Yang Mulia Kedua

02:22.560 --> 02:24.130
